+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Video Enhancer Â· Neural model</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="models.css"><main><p class="eyebrow">VIDEO ENHANCER Â· LOCAL PROCESSING</p><h1>Compact neural interpolation</h1><p class="lead">Install one small trained model. Videos are processed locally on your GPU. No video or frames are uploaded.</p><section><h2>Framegen v7-small</h2><p>About 2.9 MB of weights. The Balanced and High quality profiles use the same network at different internal resolutions.</p><p class="notice">These third-party weights are restricted to non-commercial research and personal use. Do not bundle them into a paid product or service. This is not a newly trained proprietary model.</p><p><a href="third_party/framegen/WEIGHTS_LICENSE.md" target="_blank">Read the included weights license</a></p><label><input id="consent" type="checkbox"> I have read the weights license and will use them within its terms.</label><div class="actions"><button id="download">Download and install model</button><button id="remove" class="secondary">Remove cached model</button></div><p class="muted">The download requests temporary permission for cdn.jsdelivr.net. Only .json and .bin model data are downloaded. Runtime code is included in the extension. The permission is removed after installation.</p></section><section><h2>Offline installation</h2><p>Select rt_v7s.json and rt_v7s.bin from the framegen 1.4.7 package. No network permission is needed.</p><label>Model manifest <input type="file" id="manifest" accept=".json"></label><label>Model weights <input type="file" id="binary" accept=".bin"></label><button id="import">Install selected files</button></section><section><h2>Status</h2><p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking local modelâ€¦</p><pre id="details"></pre></section><p class="muted">Neural interpolation remains experimental until tested on your browser and GPU. A trained network can still produce artifacts or miss deadlines; it is not a guarantee of clean motion.</p></main><script src="fi-quality.js"></script><script src="fi-neural-runtime.js"></script><script src="neural-model.js"></script><script src="models.js"></script></html>
